══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  NODE: instagram.like_posts
  Category: instagram
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  Like a list of posts

  Config example:
    { "credential_id": "onetap", "selectedListItems": "{{ json $json.posts }}" }

  Inputs:   item with posts array [{url, platform}]
  Outputs:  liked_count

  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Credential platform: instagram

  Fields:
    targets              Post URLs · array · required
                         Post URLs or identifiers to like.
    limit                Max Likes · number · default=20

